==Strategy==
This stage is a test to see if you have a good area attacker, like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]]. An AOE attacker like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]] and some meatshields are enough to stall, and if you have [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist]], the stalling becomes much easier. Then, get ready to spam meatshields and any other aoe attackers you have, especially Bahamut to kill off the Dagshunds. They only have 60k hp, so 1-2 hits from Bahamut is enough to kill them.

